1021 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 567 0 R
/E (An attacker can send a deauthentication frame at any time to a wireless access point, with a spoofed address for the victim. The protocol does not require any encryption for this frame, even when the session was established with Wired Equivalent Privacy \(WEP\), WPA or WPA2 for data privacy, and the attacker only needs to know the victim's MAC address, which is available in the clear through wireless network sniffing.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [9 1096 0 R 11 1097 0 R 13 1098 0 R 15 1099 0 R 17]
>>
